<p local-id=3D"15d53d22092a"><strong>Teradata:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a3478286-82b1-477d-a2e6-8484ce481420">
<li local-id=3D"b2b6d82e-0b33-4f95-af8d-96f827ad0fc4">
<p local-id=3D"db15e39c7dce">Environment Setup in Teradata that connects wi=
th AWS cloud.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"cc466a6b-8f10-42ed-a1b9-aa9549bb548c">
<p local-id=3D"b7706e9835e8">Data copy of the required Prod data to Teradat=
a NPE environment , This will be a continuous process as we have to setup d=
ata for different scenarios</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3eca81e0-fd82-40bd-98b3-8a8b55737177">
<p local-id=3D"39e90d33b421">Data setup for all different scenarios to vali=
date E2E testing</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2a5586a6c86a"><strong>GDM:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"dc1ee8222b7b">
<li local-id=3D"a3e25e6da794">
<p local-id=3D"94a9bb1e8a62">Validation of the GDM load job that will load =
the corresponding extracted data into GDM tables (Regression)</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6349ddd7e18e">
<p local-id=3D"0f9383436b3c">Validation of the GDM load(new/updated) job th=
at will load the corresponding extracted data into GDM tables (Progression)=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"6e046dc1a9c9"><strong>Data AL/CIC Layer: </strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b87d8a9a8f81">
<li local-id=3D"73358c1efbfc">
<p local-id=3D"115577415b15">Validation of the complete E2E flow with new a=
ttributes</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6a1bc542e571">
<p local-id=3D"deb5d08b7414">Validation of the new attributes (R1 Revised,R=
2)that is loaded into AL/CIC layer</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"bb9555c625f3">
<p local-id=3D"ee2930ddd128">Validation of the Data Quality and Metadata lo=
Validation of the negative scenarios for DQ when there is duplicate or data=
 issue as per the business Rule</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"cfb5a99f2a4e">
<p local-id=3D"6ff6455db342">Validation of the mapping and business rules f=
or populating the new attributes.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"23bd0467ee86">
<p local-id=3D"8f2c28f7dc0b">Validation of the file transfer from Data AL/C=
IC Layer to PEGA via MFT (TD &lt;&gt; Data lake &lt;&gt; AL/CIC layer &lt;&=
gt; MFT &lt;&gt; PEGA)</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e5317247ec01">
<p local-id=3D"a7e14bc78cae">Validation of the file transfer to TD via MFT =
(PEGA &lt;&gt; MFT &lt;&gt; AWS layer &lt;&gt; TD)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4be1b8337cbf"><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" =
data-ref=3D"c30c1377-b872-45fa-93bb-ac5b832b48d9">Pega:</span></strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7c109b9018bc">
<li local-id=3D"f27f07237e0f">
<p local-id=3D"9cc420207998">Validation of the data in Pega UI, it should h=
ave the data that is setup in Teradata</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e022ad9db51c">
<p local-id=3D"a1927bf46102">Validation of the files transferred from CIC l=
ayer to PEGA</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5d720cb21f4f"><strong>Write Back to Teradata from Illuminate=
 </strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"62a5ae953ca0">
<li local-id=3D"adb662228b3b">
<p local-id=3D"74ade5fb0b20">Validation of the data from illuminate to Tera=
data.</p>
</li>
</ul>
