<h2 local-id=3D"0581e846-f699-4213-b604-7a362602d37d" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SI=
TTestPlan-2.2Outofscope"><strong>2.2 Out of scope</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"adf8461f-20e8-4b09-a477-bacff8ae0c1c">
<li local-id=3D"de32d7e9-b0ea-411d-8708-08a89c185677">
<p local-id=3D"8b825573-80b4-499d-a8b7-1884c0834dcc"><strong>Prepaid produc=
ts and offers</strong>: The initiative focus exclusively on postpaid consum=
er offerings, excluding prepaid products and related promotions.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"a868a07d-778c-4d2f-a916-63895f01ad42">
<p local-id=3D"85e4acde-5de9-4d1d-8f29-064abc8e9b52"><strong>Business Segme=
nts</strong>: Scope is limited to postpaid consumer offerings (incl. SoHo w=
ith consumer offering); business customers are not included.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"72668756-047d-4b43-b45e-e1924656339e">
<p local-id=3D"c9fdbc4a-5e0a-46a0-8852-4e1928896019"><strong>Digital &amp; =
Self-Service Channels</strong>: Ignite R2 is focused only on human-assisted=
 channels (Contact Centre &amp; Retail); digital touchpoints remain unchang=
ed.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"023ebe18-1a67-4ed2-9503-9928546a61ef">
<p local-id=3D"23f96327-9e87-4c40-a9d2-6e15e8f6e4e7"><strong>AI/ML Model De=
velopment</strong>: Decisioning improvements leverage existing Pega CDH mod=
els and MDS integration; new AI/ML model creation is not covered.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"f99e257c-625f-4aa4-adc0-be01011b9c20">
<p local-id=3D"91fa643b-e2e7-4b8f-8dfc-286ce24820b7"><strong>Onboarding of =
ESP vendor</strong>: This will be handled with a separate SAD.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c31fc442-8364-48a0-b984-2ea676c430e6">
<p local-id=3D"1906d4f1-5258-4a0a-8856-79bc5c468b6e"><strong>Decommission o=
f current marketing platform</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0b4ab3d8-9d59-45c7-ac8f-713983b695fa">
<p local-id=3D"c74c5666-ffb1-4a39-a9e1-f9d44215993a"><strong>Pega interacti=
on history data in SAS MA and RTDM</strong>: This information will not be m=
ade available.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"eb85148d-ad48-47f0-a443-9783dadb1ab3">
<p local-id=3D"6a9ee648-e2bd-4a12-a17c-d425f6951eea"><strong>NPS campaigns =
to ResponseTek</strong>: These will not be set up in the new platform.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e9bfa412-5c72-4f10-9a5f-f11eb6175cdf">
<p local-id=3D"5684b59e-b151-42cf-b238-653440c66532"><strong>Alerts &amp; T=
riggers decision diagrams in SAS RTDM</strong>: These will not be migrated =
into the new marketing platform.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"35990391-6907-4a60-b140-bca5ba862d86">
<p local-id=3D"d43a38b8-1d7f-4c07-adbc-f76b5d44f858"><strong>MMS outbound c=
hannel</strong>: This will not be built.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"897b2bff-f238-4fbb-a07e-28c08f0377bb">
<p local-id=3D"85cf8a20-e4fe-4051-ab91-3b3a0591ee71"><strong>Integration in=
to digital personalization tool</strong>: Not included in this SAD.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"97bb5f57-3036-4d31-9b26-8d9a410169f4">
<p local-id=3D"b7216c79-66ea-4cd7-8d4c-28559d7ec6f1"><strong>Other TPG Tele=
com brands</strong>: TPG, iiNet, Internode, Lebara, AAPT &amp; Felix are no=
t included in this phase.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"389888e1-6797-4645-9cdf-6b2cb1b2e260">
<p local-id=3D"d573178b-3d77-47f8-b14c-7a6972bd10f9"><strong>Decision based=
 testing </strong>- through validation of rule engine is part of PEGA ST sc=
ope.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b89ef9fdc339">
<p local-id=3D"f0a843a6aefc">MOCN(FWA) - Best site info API is out of scope=
.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"f215c253-1f71-4b89-8fe1-11aef8b47911">
<p local-id=3D"73bc6958-ad10-4b60-bdf3-862fa970de6f"><strong>Reporting</str=
ong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a3bf312a-6f02-42c6-9965-becf2dcf2e62">
<li local-id=3D"b76c4090-715b-4649-9ad1-8adfaadec438">
<p local-id=3D"01035d28-0a5e-400b-843a-7ea4da1cda58"><span class=3D"inline-=
comment-marker" data-ref=3D"bb214e98-78a5-411c-bf88-10ada8799f30">Integrati=
on with Illuminate MDS </span>and enrichment of Pega CIC with ~137 new attr=
ibutes.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"7bfc11f4-ff42-4b9b-8ff6-f5a3ac6cc789">
<p local-id=3D"20fed533-902e-4fcd-9cbe-4933dd98e584">Bring postpaid product=
s and offer catalogue data from Siebel into Pega BoE environment for monito=
ring via MDS-Pega CIC data layer.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"618b43df-46a8-4ff1-add6-7c7c38a51758">
<p local-id=3D"7ed4fd18-b2ab-4199-a24d-1009855d32a1"><span class=3D"inline-=
comment-marker" data-ref=3D"21a003ca-919f-4423-b14c-1f4a81a51181">Build can=
ned fulfilment reports (CLM, Finance, Cops, CoE)</span></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3c472fcd-a6b4-420e-8020-40ca85d47db7">
<p local-id=3D"751283d8-d009-489e-ac95-d4a3a119a94b">Outgoing Data Enhancem=
ents:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9be72d34-ecab-4b0f-9781-6ca2ad3f5644">
<li local-id=3D"f7494be4-3cd8-4d85-b06b-126ebbf00994">
<p local-id=3D"76db5f7c-3007-4003-8880-1eadc39053ec">Interaction History</p=
>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"2669f901-88c0-4cc9-b27a-6bac4ce8def1">
<p local-id=3D"65c8ca0a-a115-496f-b3ad-f68ca2440d22">Decision History</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"7792d966-5e37-41ae-9e7a-132ba6ea642c">
<p local-id=3D"acb25918-b35f-46f0-9cad-81f750e4eb5e">Action Catalogue Data =
(from Pega).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"9ea3e5a8-3ef5-4e79-9659-1302fa539a1f" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SI=
TTestPlan-2.3TestProcessOverview"><strong>2.3 Test Process Overview</strong=
></h2>
<p local-id=3D"9b424723-b0ea-409d-9c09-32f3a7d0c588" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;"><strong>Test Planning</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6dcca846-ba68-4fe6-bc47-169e4f3076c8" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;">All test cases will be created from the functional/business requir=
ements and business processes. Below are the list of items created during t=
his phase.</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"91abaa8e-bb48-4e80-9aa6-c4e71383b487">
<li local-id=3D"f43157dc-e896-480b-876a-27fc71393339">
<p local-id=3D"f7fca7c4-8303-4bd2-bba3-14dc23d530df">Test Objective Matrix/=
Test scenarios</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"8f1491bd-fb1a-44d3-8c18-168f88b87322">
<p local-id=3D"90427f31-80b3-4525-92bc-d288383065ba">Test Cases</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b010e445-43b9-4e62-9d24-c5e5bd67ea8a">
<p local-id=3D"9ba2bdbb-2e0e-40ec-9759-17a1624dc33e">Test Results</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"4fb1b9bf-ed4a-4b8b-b3d7-2f1d2073e1ca">
<p local-id=3D"7279fa2e-53a4-4764-9763-ee4b215e8a2e">Test Summary Report</p=
>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"11c752b3-90bb-4eba-bf00-5717440a49ab">
<p local-id=3D"d9c70808-aeaa-4173-b41d-d121490b1956">Requirements Traceabil=
ity Matrix (RTM)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"dfa7b479-2ada-4ed3-b2a8-fe44ab421cd9" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;"><strong>Test Scenarios Walkthrough Sessions</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"53465771-d788-42b8-95fd-9b986f830dd6" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;">Test scenario walkthrough sessions will be held with to understand=
 what will be executed and get feedback on test coverage. All test scenario=
s/cases will have traceability back to the requirements (RTM).</p>
<p local-id=3D"c0b22bf0-eb92-4053-bdfa-119f94045a5f" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;"><strong>Test Case Execution</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"2a1e2681-65d3-4eac-8a5d-b31f35500539" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;">During test execution the tester will go through what cases that w=
ill be executed for that day. All Test execution is tracked in JIRA.</p>
<p local-id=3D"42706185-5158-486c-9385-5794bd761c23" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;">Defects will be raised in JIRA by the tester. Defect Severity and =
Priority will be triaged during the test execution window or Defect triage =
meeting.</p>
<p local-id=3D"542b452e-6666-42bb-b1d7-1df9dee4b05c" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;">The Test Lead will publish a Daily Status Reports (DSR) to keep tr=
ack of defects and issues raised and testing progress.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bd20e786-a83b-496e-bfdc-32d9e5e79558" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;"><strong>Test Summary Report</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e2e31a2d-4cc3-424c-bffc-c222a1eb72e8" style=3D"margin-left: =
30.0px;">Once all testing is complete the Test Lead will write and publish =
a Test Summary Report (TSR). The TSR will provide an update on all test cas=
es, what passed, failed, or made Not Applicable =E2=80=93 and why. The TSR =
will show all defects raised and their end status. Approvers of this docume=
nt will be asked to also approve the TSR =E2=80=93 this document. This Test=
 Plan outlines what and how things need to happen during the test phase, th=
e TSR will outline what did happen during the test phase.</p>
