<p local-id=3D"de343a9b-20b2-4457-9ad3-e62a9aad7a41">Note: OSS Testing, OAT=
 Testing and Performance Testing are out of scope for this document [Separa=
te DTP will be shared for Performance testing]</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"596b45a7-f38e-4286-a702-5952608459bc" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SI=
TTestPlan-2.4.1TestDataApproach"><strong>2.4.1 Test Data Approach</strong><=
/h3>
<p local-id=3D"00a9bc61-3ab8-4c76-8916-be12f389698e"><strong>Data Setup for=
 R2.1A SIT to get Offer Recommendations in Siebel</strong></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"a5ce04863ecf" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SITTestPlan-DataConditioni=
ngatTeraData"><strong>Data Conditioning at TeraData</strong></h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"73166b3c6ab6" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SITTestPlan-1.BaseDataPrep=
aration"><strong>1. Base Data Preparation</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"21ffa499-4e69-4aa4-9c24-dcce546dd89f">
<li local-id=3D"f7e9ad83-eec1-456f-bf42-f54b2d5a03ba">
<p local-id=3D"df4c498f6c55">Prepare <strong>~300 records</strong> of base =
data in <strong>E2E12</strong></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"1a427f5b-8d73-4f84-8a46-24a76768f0eb">
<p local-id=3D"659e51c5a020">Include <strong>different plan types</strong> =
similar to Phase 1.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"fab3753ea341" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SITTestPlan-2.BaseDataBatc=
hPreparation"><strong>2. Base Data Batch Preparation</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ed237a61-9e67-4b91-9d7a-ce91080c5fe4">
<li local-id=3D"35389f35-2dcc-4af6-be3e-60b600d858bf">
<p local-id=3D"7c68f5536803">Map the prepared data to the <strong>same 18 k=
ey CIC attributes</strong></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ac9f391a-8488-4be9-9b81-fb5b4873eb61">
<p local-id=3D"b7743b2d0908">Create a <strong>Batch Sheet</strong> for Tera=
Data processing.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3073171c-c8cb-44d9-9347-1a647fd55f64">
<p local-id=3D"274c3901b049">Share the sheet with the <strong>BI Team</stro=
ng> for conditioning.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"39cbec0ebf1f" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SITTestPlan-3.DataConditio=
ning&amp;JobExecution"><strong>3. Data Conditioning &amp; Job Execution</st=
rong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"df1f20f7a989">
<li local-id=3D"fc96a78e-9df6-4f5c-ae77-6fdeb31c854a">
<p local-id=3D"1d1127859098">The <strong>BI Team</strong> performs data con=
ditioning within <strong>TeraData</strong> tables(20+ tables)</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"89f69e811789">
<p local-id=3D"5d0a8953b4ac">BI team will perform validations of the test d=
ata across all the tables.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e8d73a68-faf8-4ec6-9771-5bc3b643a903">
<p local-id=3D"ef66dea55b06">After conditioning, the BI Team will <strong>t=
rigger the AWS airflow DAGS for data extraction from Teradata to GDM cloud.=
</strong></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b75baf7ddcd8">
<p local-id=3D"bc5c3eab2f8d"><a href=3D"https://tpgtelecom.atlassian.net/wi=
ki/spaces/IACC/pages/9399533338942/Extraction+Specifications+TD+to+DL+Refre=
sh" data-linked-resource-id=3D"9399533338942" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"4" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><u>Extraction Specifications (TD =
to DL Refresh) - IT Architecture - Confluence</u></a></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0b6ed9939a2e">
<p local-id=3D"24647903b42a">BI team will monitor and validate the data loa=
ded in GDM.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c2f131d57e98">
<p local-id=3D"3b1ea12aa9ab">Upon the completion of GDM Data load the DAGS =
in AL/CIC will be initiated and monitored.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0ecf188c1752">
<p local-id=3D"cda9362772a9">BI team will check for parquet file generation=
 and its movement to PEGA via MFT. Below are the 5 distinct files generated=
</p>
<ul local-id=3D"59a365a32b11">
<li local-id=3D"59f614cb3a1d">
<p local-id=3D"ba93d027c9e3">Subscription</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"53a4b1ef2e37">
<p local-id=3D"42fe16099b5c">Model score</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"78a37228d60c">
<p local-id=3D"78344e5ed6f2">Account</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"12133af69550">
<p local-id=3D"856a409b772b">Billing Account</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"c58e48b62841">
<p local-id=3D"2697645f7ee3">Holding</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e0c4c14e18fd">
<p local-id=3D"da76d8096084">BI team will monitor the files received in PEG=
A and loaded.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"cf538afc1f78" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SITTestPlan-4.DataFlow"><s=
trong>4. <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"4ca52ed3-3f87-42=
e7-943a-c54900fa2c53">Data Flow</span></strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"b46608e1e765">Once the job is triggered, the data flows in t=
he following order:</p>
<p local-id=3D"8639cca72eeb">TeraData =E2=86=92 GDM =E2=86=92 AL/CIC =E2=86=
=92 Pega CDH =E2=86=92 Siebel</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"8a53988f-6508-46eb-b518-8593ac383678" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SI=
TTestPlan-2.5RACIMatrix"><strong>2.5 RACI Matrix</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"c4ef15c4-c95d-4060-946b-5534ee3aa91b">Please note that the b=
elow matrix is just presented as an example, each project will need to adap=
t to its own matrix based on the responsibilities agreed.</p>
