<h2 local-id=3D"93810abb-03df-4371-8b15-80d0a85c8aa7" id=3D"Ignite|R2.1a|SI=
TTestPlan-3.1DefectClassification"><strong>3.1 Defect Classification</stron=
g></h2>
<p local-id=3D"caebe476-861d-41d3-84c9-393abbd145cb"><strong>Severity</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"2bd85173-ed75-45eb-b7da-4bbe1cc9bef4"><span style=3D"color: =
rgb(0,0,0);">Severity is an objective measure of the impact that the defect=
 has on the product. This should be based on what the impact would be if th=
e defect were to occur in production. The severity will be assigned based o=
n the following criteria:</span></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"996" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"69=
ff7e9e-8379-4ce6-909d-4e3d8cdd44bb" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 499.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 497.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2a347139-7238-4b45-842e-d671d6c25d90">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#DBE5F1" data-local-id=3D"aab8ceeb-c3cd-41e9-8=
923-86c821302553" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"847bd80b-9a0a-441c-8fc6-c0ff101252c1"><strong>Severity</stro=
ng></p>
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#DBE5F1" data-local-id=3D"68d3abf5-4281-4e6b-b=
43b-3cde86d94d15" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22089743-e5a3-4d72-a119-f7e9fdf24948"><strong>Criteria</stro=
ng></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d41006ce-66b3-4e46-a27e-2190ba440573">
<td data-local-id=3D"b91dcc14-71a8-4f7a-979a-4bfd4e63352a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"81136b78-3f71-4d88-98db-ff09de7a7b77">Severity 1 =E2=80=93 C=
ritical</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7406c794-0ecb-4724-b707-5ad9a5404a45" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2490d609-34c0-48ab-838f-bfeb34d5c7ce">A critical issue is wh=
ere a large piece of functionality or major system component is completely =
broken. There is no workaround.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3c91b4a5-ee5d-49f1-8e83-b9652f31b9f2">
<td data-local-id=3D"9eadb2a1-10db-49a0-bb1c-e0c9610592ba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f2ab9b7-5582-4454-97e1-62bc87b1ee5d">Severity 2 =E2=80=93 M=
ajor</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fb673aa4-ef89-468e-8d61-7253193456f2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c39e1cdf-51e9-4663-bf85-b81ac6429b16">A major issue is where=
 a large piece of functionality or major system component is not working pr=
operly but a workaround exists, or a moderately used piece of functionality=
 is completely broken.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"137d0482-ac57-4a44-ac4f-fea07960f9a5">
<td data-local-id=3D"b1680836-96e8-412c-b1b8-afdfb501d9fc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2bb47eda-424c-48c3-9477-b5d1fe2c3180">Severity 3 =E2=80=93 M=
oderate</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"65255f69-950a-4a78-93eb-336ef5f10213" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bcdf3d83-5566-4281-9a90-be52475c8e77">A moderate defect prev=
ents full use of features but can be avoided using workarounds.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"190536fe-711f-4d04-a189-c3f3ab816f33">
<td data-local-id=3D"0dd1dede-5470-4bfb-91a7-37b64a7dda05" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
