<p local-id=3D"d9870a59-af0f-4f53-b879-dbc618412a2b"><strong>Priority</stro=
ng></p>
<p local-id=3D"ff021210-7b09-42db-a031-0da1302add66"><span style=3D"color: =
rgb(0,0,0);"> Priority is a subjective measure on how important it is that =
the defect is fixed. The testing team will set the initial priority which m=
ay be changed following discussion at the defect management meeting.</span>=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"9c2ec010-499d-45b0-b13f-c98274d57c85"><span style=3D"color: =
rgb(0,0,0);"> The priority will be assigned based on the following guidelin=
es:</span></p>
