<td data-local-id=3D"14a0f2eb-719c-409b-8347-66a85168ee4b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e149127d-c753-4dda-a1e4-7d47b4cefe3a">This has a moderate im=
pact on testing. The flaw should be fixed if there is time, but it can be d=
