<p local-id=3D"95980fd5-0440-4d58-b312-2b404931380d">Critical - cannot prog=
ress further (showstopper).</p>
<p local-id=3D"d2c624a1-fcfa-4545-a2a2-813861e5b053">Must be resolved ASAP.=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"9d001a23-059f-4758-944d-6ca90be4ea99">Examples:</p>
<p local-id=3D"fa0cc10d-6845-40a6-a34b-fe6908006f07">Essential function is =
not working at all, and no practical workaround exists.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5ac13ef6-1a79-45bf-8c4e-01801540d323">Program aborts or stop=
s.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ebbd0dbd-a621-4e1b-8c71-964ee5668d81">Serious database corru=
ption.</p>
<p local-id=3D"acabf083-0241-48e3-bc52-ad049bf0e321">Major interface proble=
m which stops down-stream processes</p>
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#FFFFFF" data-local-id=3D"76983b93-aa7b-45ed-a=
d25-5a5303b9c594" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f2ff3fa-197e-474f-87e9-117d0f8e5d20">&lt; 1 hour&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#FFFFFF" data-local-id=3D"dcaf681e-7dd6-488e-8=
223-fb94d76a0c67" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d013472-877b-40e0-bfeb-b50955f591e8">&lt; 24 hours&nbsp;</p=
>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e757b9af-2262-4b63-b62f-2d6dbbe2c534">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#FFFFFF" data-local-id=3D"78c3efe9-180c-4529-a=
846-6314dc488d56" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef52133e-402a-4a16-9772-6884384e1fd3" style=3D"text-align: c=
enter;">P2</p>
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#FFFFFF" data-local-id=3D"762cc0ad-4bd9-467a-b=
16b-b7ce606447aa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96c0f58b-57f0-4057-8517-6bad08f686bd">High - serious impact,=
 possible work around.</p>
<p local-id=3D"97bc07e8-8533-425b-8710-17adeabd758b">Must be resolved ASAP.=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"bd12dd68-06db-46d4-9361-88dc3470bbbd">Examples:</p>
<p local-id=3D"c3157455-a014-40e2-828d-38ca2ba3673c">Essential functions ar=
e severely restricted.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2cd5a1c4-a9b8-4666-8dd2-ab97a3aaceef">Essential function not=
 working, practical workaround available.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7c8933fc-4716-4ad9-bf8a-7106f548fb16">Restricted performance=
, logic problem.</p>
<p local-id=3D"788d1580-4922-48b6-a9ea-7800699d0910">Causes severe restrict=
ion to essential up-stream or down-stream processes.</p>
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#FFFFFF" data-local-id=3D"dc369ab7-341a-47bc-9=
