<p local-id=3D"5108b3bc-e6fc-4fb7-91dd-02dc33f10969"><strong><span style=3D=
"color: rgb(255,255,255);">Description of Assumption</span></strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e02796f1-c735-408c-8627-d2b0a4845ada">
<td data-local-id=3D"b898389e-133f-4598-a655-8f2da4153d03" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f97dc368-d6db-417f-a23b-96da30ac6385">1.<span style=3D"color=
: rgb(23,43,77);"> </span>Project scope will not change once the TOM &amp; =
Test cases are approved. Any changes to scope will be mutually governed and=
 discussed.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8a1d22e7-e432-4ebf-9dac-b25ef01abe5f">
<td data-local-id=3D"7bcd91d9-a86a-4386-bbfe-90d328803f39" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08c047aa-3904-4b60-8d73-299de14ffcad">2.<span style=3D"color=
: rgb(23,43,77);"> </span>A stable environment will be available to the pro=
ject teams during test execution phase. No significant change to the enviro=
nment will occur once test stage is commenced.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c12d72a9-d437-452b-839a-606df1e72be0">
<td data-local-id=3D"5f92ac76-c05f-4a8f-99e3-aa331d4b7c27" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
