<li local-id=3D"1254808f-5c2d-417d-a966-ed50e6452dd9">
<p local-id=3D"2105ece3-fc27-4a66-98a8-54f6c0e1ffe3">Base Data preparation =
owned by SIT Testing Team (TCS) and Data Ingestion to PEGA CDH in E2E envir=
onment for different type of scenarios owned by Teradata Team (TCS)</p>
</li>
</ol>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"979dbcb4-3105-441a-a593-5ded26dd3ac2">
