nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74f5aa16-8e7d-4985-85d7-38804f9c7394">4.<span style=3D"color=
: rgb(0,0,0);"> </span>Any change requirements will need to go through an i=
mpact assessment from timeline, effort, and scope perspective.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cc0616d7-c57c-4a8d-a1cf-1c14e664e8d8">
<td data-local-id=3D"ea87d568-fc90-43d6-90e7-94b0cbc1caf4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22970fed-7d8f-4571-bd29-6c9e91cce239">5. Not all offers/rule=
s/scenarios will be tested and only required functionality will be tested a=
nd the same has to be approved by architect</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f51fd4bf-9b62-472f-a1a7-bcfce0b7e13f">
<td data-local-id=3D"62c6211c-ca60-40eb-b889-4da62bb1f482" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"92eff1e2-3b74-489a-8c5e-ed5f91bd1d2d">6. Raised defects are =
fixed on time as per defect SLA.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2aa42f22-075f-4a6e-b189-bac1966e7842">
<td data-local-id=3D"2ee6e819-5710-4abe-9572-2fa48fe67a2b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9cfb6562-d190-47c5-ad90-72bc894a3b71">7. Approvals for the T=
est Strategy, TOM, Test Summary Results, and all other applicable test arte=
facts will be received on time.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b1ccb7f2-2486-4111-acf7-a464510f451f">
<td data-local-id=3D"8ddcb57f-8786-4ec8-a018-58e6d2b45dfc" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51650316-7db7-4c0b-9bf0-7a399bc317bd">8. Offer Recommendatio=
n validations will be mix and match for different scenarios for different c=
ustomer type and offers. 1:1 offer mapping test is not considered. The no.o=
f test cases will increase if we need to test each offer &amp; change appli=
cable w.r.t each offer, and additional time is required if it has to be cat=
ered.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a0bee752-d150-4a14-aba3-e29f14fb5796">
<td data-local-id=3D"3f27f71a-fadf-43e5-93b2-fe7c31a58808" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa250f08-e270-4b4a-9218-7bf13a074635">9. Since UAT scope is =
not yet defined, only minimal test data support effort is considered. If fu=
rther support is required, it will be a CR.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eb2bf265-1e28-4927-af8f-77bb59973fb2">
<td data-local-id=3D"0b13fabb-0b66-4b06-99a8-4369f3720986" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5fdf61af-37bb-4ecb-8629-d6290fe738ee">10. 5% of progression =
scenarios only considered to validate invoices for different offers. No reg=
ression testing is considered</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8b1b0e19-fab9-4174-9f0a-69a304f885be">
<td data-local-id=3D"8f89a0f9-cac7-409e-99e4-8aa05385fb6d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<ol start=3D"11" local-id=3D"18ee6aff66df">
<li local-id=3D"f906e0cc1010">
<p local-id=3D"d08b976a-6f18-4a10-9ad9-487b04076d0c">Ignite will use SSJ&nb=
sp;capabilities to get plans, devices, and prices directly from the Siebel =
BAU Matrix.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
